{"format":"hologram.registry.artifact/v1","id":"artifacthub/grafana/loki","fetched":"2026-09-25T12:16:55.237Z","source":{"name":"Artifact Hub","api":"https://artifacthub.io/api/v1/packages/helm/grafana/loki","page":"https://artifacthub.io/packages/helm/grafana/loki"},"readme":"# loki\n\n![Version: 7.3.0](https://img.shields.io/badge/Version-7.3.0-informational?style=flat-square) ![Type: application](https://img.shields.io/badge/Type-application-informational?style=flat-square) ![AppVersion: 3.6.12](https://img.shields.io/badge/AppVersion-3.6.12-informational?style=flat-square)\n\nHelm chart for Grafana Enterprise Logs supporting monolithic, simple scalable, and microservices modes.\n\n## ⚠️ Helm Chart Migration\nAs of March 16, 2026, the Grafana Loki Helm chart for OSS users has moved to [grafana-community/helm-charts](https://github.com/grafana-community/helm-charts) (forked at chart version 6.55.0). OSS users are encouraged to migrate to the community-maintained chart. The chart in this repository is now maintained for Grafana Enterprise Logs (GEL) users only. See [#20705](https://github.com/grafana/loki/issues/20705) for details.\n\n## Source Code\n\n* <https://github.com/grafana/loki>\n* <https://grafana.com/oss/loki/>\n* <https://grafana.com/docs/loki/latest/>\n\n## Requirements\n\n| Repository | Name | Version |\n|------------|------|---------|\n| https://charts.min.io/ | minio(minio) | 5.4.0 |\n| https://grafana.github.io/helm-charts | grafana-agent-operator(grafana-agent-operator) | 0.5.2 |\n| https://grafana.github.io/helm-charts | rollout_operator(rollout-operator) | 0.47.0 |\n\nFind more information in the Loki Helm Chart [documentation](https://grafana.com/docs/loki/latest/setup/install/helm/).\n\n## Contributing\n\nPlease see our [Helm Contributing Guidelines](./CONTRIBUTING.md) for detailed information about contributing to the Loki Helm Chart.\n\n## Releases\n\nNormally, contributors need _not_ bump the Chart version. A new version of the Chart will follow this cadence:\n- Automatic weekly releases\n- Releases that coincide with Loki/GEL releases\n- Manual releases when necessary (ie. to address a CVE or critical bug)","readmeBase":"https://grafana.github.io/helm-charts","publisher":{"name":"Grafana","url":"https://artifacthub.io/packages/search?org=grafana","official":false,"verified":false,"cncf":false},"registered":null,"updated":"2026-08-10T20:06:24.000Z","categories":[],"keywords":[],"license":null,"links":[{"name":"home","url":"https://grafana.github.io/helm-charts"},{"name":"source","url":"https://github.com/grafana/loki"},{"name":"source","url":"https://grafana.com/oss/loki/"},{"name":"source","url":"https://grafana.com/docs/loki/latest/"},{"name":"Grafana repository","url":"https://grafana.github.io/helm-charts"}],"maintainers":[],"stats":{"pulls":null,"stars":332,"subscriptions":189},"mediaTypes":[],"contentTypes":[],"storage":null,"tags":[{"name":"7.3.0","digest":"sha256:04a339f712d770a1f599f05fc0a5a3cde18e43914e49ae6a49f7171be86bcc09","pushed":"2026-08-10T20:06:24.000Z","size":null,"platforms":[],"mediaType":null,"status":null,"appVersion":"3.6.12"},{"name":"7.2.0","digest":null,"pushed":"2026-07-29T20:35:29.000Z","size":null,"platforms":[],"mediaType":null,"status":null,"appVersion":"3.6.11"},{"name":"7.1.0","digest":null,"pushed":"2026-07-15T15:36:42.000Z","size":null,"platforms":[],"mediaType":null,"status":null,"appVersion":"3.6.8"},{"name":"7.0.0","digest":null,"pushed":"2026-04-23T20:11:38.000Z","size":null,"platforms":[],"mediaType":null,"status":null,"appVersion":"3.6.7"},{"name":"6.55.0","digest":null,"pushed":"2026-03-11T22:00:42.000Z","size":null,"platforms":[],"mediaType":null,"status":null,"appVersion":"3.6.7"},{"name":"6.54.0","digest":null,"pushed":"2026-03-10T23:50:15.000Z","size":null,"platforms":[],"mediaType":null,"status":null,"appVersion":"3.6.7"},{"name":"6.53.0","digest":null,"pushed":"2026-02-10T15:03:16.000Z","size":null,"platforms":[],"mediaType":null,"status":null,"appVersi